# JNI 入口和反射回调保留名字与签名，不能依赖是否启用了项目包优化。
-keep class com.github.zzwtsy.chuanmen.lib.vpn.NativeBindings {
    public static native java.lang.String request(java.lang.String, com.github.zzwtsy.chuanmen.lib.vpn.ProtectorCallback);
}
-keepclassmembers class com.github.zzwtsy.chuanmen.lib.vpn.ProtectorCallback {
    public boolean protectForNative(int, java.lang.String, long);
}
